plugin_connector_68df33b1a2d081918778431.longDescription:
Bring your Canva design workflow into Codex and create, refine, and review designs through natural conversation.

What Canva can do: 
Create designs: Turn a brief, outline, or draft copy into a presentation, doc, poster, flyer, social post, resume, and more. 
Generate images: Create photos, illustrations, icons, and graphics from a prompt, or restyle an image you already have. 
Remove backgrounds: Lift the subject out of an image onto a transparent background. Upload files: Bring attachments and files from your chat into Canva to use in your designs. 
Resize for social media: Adapt a design for Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn in one step. 
Bulk create: Generate multiple designs from spreadsheet data using a brand template. 
Edit designs: Update text, media, and formatting, or reposition and resize elements. 
Get design feedback: Receive structured feedback on visual hierarchy, layout, readability, consistency, and accessibility. 
Implement feedback: Review comment threads and apply clear, actionable changes. Brand check: Check colors, fonts, logo usage, and copy against your Brand Kit.

Once installed, describe what you want in plain language or invoke Canva directly with @Canva.

Try prompts like:

@Canva, create a pitch deck from this outline.
@Canva, make an Instagram post announcing our Friday sale.
@Canva, generate an illustration of a lighthouse at dawn.
@Canva, remove the background from this photo.
@Canva, upload this PDF and turn it into a presentation.
@Canva, resize this design for social media.
@Canva, create designs from this spreadsheet using my brand template.
@Canva, update the headline in this design.
@Canva, implement the feedback in the comment threads.
@Canva, check this design against my Brand Kit.
Requirements: Connect your Canva account to use the plugin. Bulk Create requires an eligible Canva Enterprise plan. Design and image generation use Canva AI credits.

Want to take a more hands-on approach? Instantly open your design in Canva's powerful editor for the final touches.

